      "sourceTextSha256": "eaf98752cebfb564a25c17dd4fac596c78ba0fe482ddbbc6e0e8f84f431a5874",
      "text": "Day 7 · Breakfast at the hotel and transfer to the airport for your flight to Salta. On arrival, transfer to Cafayate (approx. 3 hours), a wine-producing town. Visit one of the main wineries, where a guide explains grape growing, harvesting and the production of different wines, followed by free time among the wineries and vineyards and a visit to the Wine Museum. Lunch on the main square (not included). Overnight in a wine hotel.",
